      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Please put some research into an application called SRWorksRuntime.exe . It's made by HTC, and uses your HMD's camera to track your hands for finger tracking.\nSee demo here:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zRrrKAjibGc\nThis demo shows it working on a HTC Vive Pro, but it doesn't even need to be that HMD or even the camera on that HMD. It can also be a chest mounted camera.\nYou also might want to get involved with the LucasVR  gloves community. They have hand tracking gloves that allow for splay and the like. They were even showcased in a Linus Tech Tips video. Hope this helps you.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
